# Sync package

- Read `docs/features/google-sync-and-sse-flow.md` before changing provider,
  watch, OAuth, import, or connection-health behavior.
- Backend, Google sync, MongoDB, and SSE work requires a root `compass.yaml`.
  Bootstrap from `compass.example.yaml`; never commit the generated file.
- Use `bun run test:sync:fast` for Mongo-free work and `bun run test:sync` for
  persistence or full package coverage.
- Shared event names and payloads belong in `packages/core`.
- For cross-package behavior, verify the affected backend/web consumers and run
  `bun run type-check`.
- Distinguish browser-to-backend SSE traffic from Google-to-Compass webhook
  traffic; local webhook delivery requires a public HTTPS URL.
